BT /F2 18 Tf 50 761 Td (Cargolane Platform Overview) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 729 Td (*Warehouse automation, WMS, TMS and cold-chain visibility from one accountable partner.*) Tj ET
BT /F2 14 Tf 50 678 Td (Who we are) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 646 Td (Cargolane Logistics Tech is a supply chain technology company headquartered in Gurugram,) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 630 Td (    India. We design, deploy and operate automated warehouses and the software that runs them.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 614 Td (    Our customers include D2C brands, e-commerce marketplaces, omnichannel retailers, FMCG) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 598 Td (    companies, third-party logistics providers, port and ICD operators, and pharma and) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 582 Td (    cold-chain distributors across India, the UAE, Singapore, Indonesia, Thailand and the United) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 566 Td (    Kingdom.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 534 Td (Most supply chain teams today stitch together a robot vendor, a WMS vendor, a transport tool) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 518 Td (    and a separate temperature-logging provider. When something breaks during a festive peak,) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 502 Td (    nobody owns the problem. Cargolane was founded to be the single accountable partner for the) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 486 Td (    whole flow, from inbound dock to customer doorstep.) Tj ET
BT /F2 14 Tf 50 435 Td (The platform) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 403 Td (LaneFlow WMS. A cloud warehouse management system for single-client and multi-client sites.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 387 Td (    LaneFlow covers receiving, putaway, wave and zone picking, packing, returns, batch and) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 371 Td (    expiry tracking, and kitting. It ships with connectors to more than 40 marketplaces, ERPs) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 355 Td (    and carrier platforms, and natively orchestrates our robots and sorters, so there is no) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 339 Td (    middleware layer to maintain.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 307 Td (LaneRoute TMS. A transport management system for primary, secondary and last-mile) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 291 Td (    distribution. LaneRoute plans loads, optimises routes around time windows and vehicle) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 275 Td (    constraints, runs carrier procurement and freight audit, and gives customers live tracking) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 259 Td (    links. Typical customers reduce freight cost by 10 to 18 percent within six months.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 227 Td (LaneBot AMR Fleet. Goods-to-person autonomous mobile robots that bring shelving pods to) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 211 Td (    ergonomic pick stations. Pickers move from roughly 90 to 300 order lines per hour, and new) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 195 Td (    staff become productive in a single shift, which matters when seasonal hiring doubles your) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 179 Td (    workforce.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 147 Td (LaneSort. Modular cross-belt and pouch sorters with dimensioning and weighing, from 4,000 to) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 131 Td (    20,000 parcels per hour, for sortation hubs, fulfilment centres and returns centres.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 99 Td (LaneStack AS/RS. High-density shuttle and pallet storage, including frozen-store variants) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 83 Td (    rated to minus 25 degrees, delivered with certified integration partners.) Tj ET
